## 4. Shared Models

### `UserPreferences` Structure
```json
{
  "budget_range": {
    "min": 0,
    "max": 100000
  },
  "travel_style": ["string"],
  "interests": ["string"],
  "preferred_climate": ["string"],
  "preferred_destinations": ["string"],
  "accommodation_type": ["string"],
  "food_preferences": ["string"],
  "activity_preferences": ["string"],
  "risk_tolerance": "string"
}
```

### `UserResponse` Structure
```json
{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "name": "Jane User",
  "_id": "60ab1...",
  "created_at": "ISO-Date",
  "updated_at": "ISO-Date",
  "preferences": {}, // Matches UserPreferences structure
  "metadata": {
    "last_login": "ISO-Date",
    "total_trips": 2
  }
}
```
